{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 585230, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 117542, "uid": 63428, "type": 4, "title": "4.27 暗Raid攻略", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1677925786, "updated_at": 1682644884, "updated_uid": 63428, "comment_at": 1685003697, "last_at": 1685003697, "comment_count": 291, "status": 1, "summary": "本期的Boss主要是以减速、拆Buff为主的折磨型，伤害能力中等偏上。对于Boss的几大难点，有以下事项需要注意：1.Boss的高频拆Buff和减速效果非常难应对，最好的办法就是带上有debuff解除", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1157/h_1367/202/63428/2023/3/28/648933.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1512/h_6794/202/63428/2023/3/28/729483.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_1000/202/63428/2023/3/28/90099.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 18, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 69971, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "江西省", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 7, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 585230, "content": "<div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"Boss技能分析\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1157\" data-height=\"1367\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1157/h_1367/202/63428/2023/3/28/648933.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1157/h_1367/202/63428/2023/3/28/648933.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><div class=\"div-img\">本期的Boss主要是以减速、拆Buff为主的折磨型，伤害能力中等偏上。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 2, 2);\"></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(185, 2, 2);\">对于Boss的几大难点，有以下事项需要注意：</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\">1.Boss的高频拆Buff和减速效果非常难应对，最好的办法就是<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">带上有debuff解除/免疫类的角色</span>，例如秋牡丹。此外光赛美勒的时间扭曲非常克制本期Boss，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">如果队伍中缺少赛美勒会被折磨得很惨。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">2.Boss的加速暂时无法处理，Raid不值得浪费一个位置带甜甜圈。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">3.<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Boss的减益回避率降低才是最危险的Debuff</span>，一旦吃到，接下来的24秒内所有Debuff我们都会被打中，所以我们要尽可能解除它。<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(185, 2, 2);\">（秋牡丹非常关键）</span></div><br></div><div>4.攻击力降低有前置条件，就是你身上有减速，所以<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">如果想不吃减攻击，我们就要尽可能洗掉刀身上的减速效果</span>，又要提到秋牡丹了，她有高攻击力的2体无敌效果，对刀的保护效果非常好。</div><div><br></div><div>5.不要问为什么辅助在打FT，问就是<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(185, 2, 2);\">刀吃减攻了</span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(185, 2, 2);\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(185, 2, 2);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">总结一句话：能带秋牡丹的全都给我带上，永远记住秋牡丹是你永远的爹</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">（替换光莫娜和尼曼）</span></span></div></span><div></div><div><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"Raid对策分析\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">奥拉夫评价</div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1512\" data-height=\"6794\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1512/h_6794/202/63428/2023/3/28/729483.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1512/h_6794/202/63428/2023/3/28/729483.png\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div>本期奥拉夫虽然在没有艳后的条件下表现一般，但不妨碍她是潜力最高的Raid光刀，后续日服的新辅助也为奥拉夫量身定制<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">（策划：虽然我们奥拉夫做的垃圾，但我们有售后服务，今后的辅助全都为奥拉夫量身定制，我看你养还是不养）</span>，所以说<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(185, 2, 2);\">有能力点火奥拉夫的，我都建议你点满火。</span></div><div>最后送上几张奥拉夫的日服伤害图：</div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">（均为自动打的，没有特地凹伤害）</span></div></span><div></div><div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"600\" data-height=\"1000\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_1000/202/63428/2023/3/28/90099.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_1000/202/63428/2023/3/28/90099.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\">1层RB伤害测试 120万FT（非极限伤害）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"600\" data-height=\"1000\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_1000/202/63428/2023/3/28/847595.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_1000/202/63428/2023/3/28/847595.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\">30车Raid伤害测试 60万FT（非极限伤害）</div><br></div><div><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"Buff表\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1191\" data-height=\"3072\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1191/h_3072/202/63428/202